+Skill 是否有效必须用行为反例或独立审查证明：按旧规则会在真实或构造案例上做出错误动作，或独立审查确认新规则堵住该动作。关键词/子串 checker 只能做静态辅助（例如列出某短语是否出现），不得作为 Skill `GO`。已知坏实现：把必需要求短语拼进一个文件就能让子串 checker 变绿。
 
-- Isolation: source env.md then export DATA_DIR under `/tmp` or `/private/tmp`; start must refuse workspace data/. Never let env.md clobber an isolated directory (ISO-001).
-- Executor pin: when the run freezes Cursor Grok 4.6 Extra High Fast, do not substitute Orca, Codex, or Luna.
-- Fresh-context verifier: launch a detached reviewer with the Task tool, the frozen model id, run_in_background, and forbid resume. Reviewer is read-only on the candidate plus original evidence; it must not edit code, read the implementer summary, or self-approve.
-- CJK docs in this repo: write them with Python Path.write_text and unicode escapes; do not use editor Write/StrReplace for CJK.
-- Screenshots: do not rely on file://; serve evidence HTML on a temporary localhost HTTP server and shut it down after capture.
-- REVIEW_PASS ledger rows must not be reverted to FAIL. If 10.2 requires a re-probe, add this-run evidence only.
-- Freeze phase: do not edit CASES.json during freeze. Update the unique ledger only after the run verdict is written, and only when authorized.
-- Continue: do not stop to wait for the user when instructed to continue. Grilling wait-for-answers does not apply to an already-frozen acceptance run.
-- Release: incomplete 10.2 is NO_GO / INCOMPLETE. Green pytest counts, including 109 passed, are not product GO.
